# Default - dev-infra owns all files
*   @aerospike/dev-infra

# Gate definitions apply to each caller as soon as they merge.
# The last matching line wins, so each gate line keeps @aerospike/dev-infra.
/.github/gates/STAGE.json     @aerospike/dev-infra @aerospike/qe
/.github/gates/PREVIEW.json   @aerospike/dev-infra @aerospike/product
/.github/gates/PROD.json      @aerospike/dev-infra @aerospike/product @aerospike/seceng
/.github/gates/INTERNAL.json  @aerospike/dev-infra @aerospike/product
